{"id":"claim:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--kuni-indirect-speech-future-desire","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements","topics":["topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements","topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--indirect-speech"],"statement":{"en":"As an indirect-speech complementizer, kuni expresses future events, inferences, or desired realizations.","ja":"間接話法の標識としての kuni は、これから起こること、推量したこと、実現を願うことを表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"unstated","conditions":["indirect speech"]},"forms":["kuni"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0472-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[{"kind":"supports","claim":"claim:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--kuni-nominalizer-prospective-speech","differs_in":null,"note":"Both characterize the prospective/future value of kuni when embedding speech or thought complements."}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--kuni-quotationalizer-shizunai","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements","topics":["topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements","topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--indirect-speech"],"statement":{"en":"In Shizunai, kuni is analyzed as a quotationalizer because it is always followed by a verb of thinking or feeling.","ja":"静内方言において kuni は常に思考や感情を表す動詞に後続されるため、引用辞として分類される。"},"type":"analysis","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"unstated","conditions":[]},"forms":["kuni"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0030-12","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[{"kind":"refines","claim":"claim:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--kuni-functions-as-quotationalizer","differs_in":"scope","note":"Refsing motivates the quotationalizer analysis from the specific verbal collocations in Shizunai."}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--kuni-thought-probability-necessity","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements","topics":["topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements","topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--indirect-speech"],"statement":{"en":"In Shizunai, the quotationalizer kuni implies that the thought or impression is bound to be or will necessarily be so.","ja":"静内方言において引用詞 kuni は、考えや印象の内容が必然的または蓋然的であることを含意する。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"unstated","conditions":[]},"forms":["kuni"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0246-08","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--kuni-nominalizer-prospective-speech","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements","topics":["topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements","topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--indirect-speech"],"statement":{"en":"kuni nominalizes a clause with future or prospective meaning and frequently co-occurs with verbs such as ramu 'think' or ye 'say'.","ja":"kuni は未来の意味を含みつつ節を名詞化し、後ろに ramu「思う」や ye「言う」などの動詞を取ることが多い。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"unstated","conditions":[]},"forms":["kuni","ramu","ye"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0136-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--kuni-ne-purposive-conjunction","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements","topics":["topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements","topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--kuni-ne"],"statement":{"en":"The conjunction or marker kuni-ne means 'in order that' or 'so that'.","ja":"kuni-ne は「…するように」を意味し目的を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"unstated","conditions":[]},"forms":["kuni-ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0207-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--kunine-manner-purpose-hokkaido","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements","topics":["topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements","topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--kuni-ne"],"statement":{"en":"kunine means 'so that' or 'in such a way that'.","ja":"kunine は「〜するように」を意味する。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"unstated","conditions":[]},"forms":["kunine"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0070-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[{"kind":"refines","claim":"claim:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--kuni-ne-purposive-conjunction","differs_in":"scope","note":"Satō (2008) describes the purposive function specifically within Hokkaido Ainu."}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--kunak-derived-from-kun-yak","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements","topics":["topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements","topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--morphology-status"],"statement":{"en":"The conjunction kunak is derived from kun-yak and corresponds to the fourth meaning of kuni.","ja":"接続詞 kunak は kun-yak に由来し、kuni の第4用法と同等である。"},"type":"diachrony","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"unstated","conditions":[]},"forms":["kunak","kun-yak","kuni"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0163-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--kuni-speaker-expectation-modal","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements","topics":["topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements","topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--system"],"statement":{"en":"kuni expresses the speaker's expectation that something ought to be or surely must be.","ja":"kuni は「当然…の筈」または「きっと…に違いない」という話者の期待を示す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"unstated","conditions":[]},"forms":["kuni"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0206-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[{"kind":"supports","claim":"claim:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--kuni-expectative-mood-purposive","differs_in":null,"note":"Both describe the modal expectative meaning ('ought to be' / 'must be') of kuni."}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--kuni-future-gentle-command","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements","topics":["topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements","topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--system"],"statement":{"en":"kuni is used for the future tense or gentle commands.","ja":"kuni は未来または柔らかな命令に用いられる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"unstated","conditions":[]},"forms":["kuni"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0207-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--kuni-functions-as-quotationalizer","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements","topics":["topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements","topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--system"],"statement":{"en":"kuni functions as a quotationalizer.","ja":"kuni は引用化辞として機能する。"},"type":"analysis","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"unstated","conditions":[]},"forms":["kuni"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0028-07","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--kuni-complementizer-quotative-particle","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements","topics":["topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements","topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--system"],"statement":{"en":"kuni functions as a complementizer or quotative particle meaning 'that...'.","ja":"kuni は「〜と」を意味する補文標識・引用助詞である。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"unstated","conditions":[]},"forms":["kuni"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0387-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--kuni-expectative-mood-purposive","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements","topics":["topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements","topic:complex/kuni-complementizer-purpose-complements--system"],"statement":{"en":"Expectative mood ('it must be') is expressed by the particle kuni, which also has the meaning 'in order that'.","ja":"予想・期待法（「〜に違いない」）は助詞 kuni によって表され、この助詞には「〜のために」の意味もある。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"unstated","conditions":[]},"forms":["kuni"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:shibatani1990@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0051-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
